{#- The one tooltip of the page, placed once by the layout and moved to
    whatever asks for it: an element carrying `data-tooltip` — written by hand,
    by `tooltip()` in twig, or bound in a vue — gets it under the pointer and
    under the keyboard's focus. -#}
<div class="tooltip" role="tooltip" id="tooltip" hidden>
    <strong class="tooltip--title" hidden></strong>
    <span class="tooltip--text"></span>
    <span class="tooltip--arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</div>
